.blurb
    | Vaporwave VR Painter is a paint tool for creating VR environments in the vaporwave aesthetic,
    | which was popularized circa 2016 and draws on “retro technology” imagery: old-school Windows UI, early video
    | games and websites, etc. The music and environment reflect this aesthetic, as does the tool itself.
